'log_FIRSTPAGE_DESC' => '(en)This panel allows you to view or download the log files generated by the services running on your server.',
'log_LOG_FILE_SELECT_DESC' => '(en)Choose a log file to view',
'log_FILTER_PATTERN_DESC' => '(en)You may optionally specify a filter pattern to display only the lines from the log file which match this pattern. If you leave this field blank, all available lines of the log file will be displayed. Note that this option is not used if you download the logfile.',
'log_FILTER_PATTERN_LABEL' => 'フィルターパターン（任意）',
'log_MATCH_PATTERN_DESC' => '(en)You may also optionally specify a highlight pattern to mark in bold any lines from the log file which match the highlight pattern. The highlight pattern is applied to any lines which have already matched the filter pattern. Note that this option is not used if you download the logfile.',
'log_MATCH_PATTERN_LABEL' => 'ハイライトパターン（任意）',
'log_END_DESC' => '(en)Please note that it may take quite some time to generate these reports.',
'log_VIEW' => 'ログファイルを表示',
'log_LOG_FILE_EMPTY' => 'ログファイル「[_1]」は空です！',
'log_VIEWING_TIME' => '[_1] で表示しました。',
'log_MATCH_HEADER' => '次に一致する行を表示しています: "[_1]"',
'log_HIGHLIGHT_HEADER' => '「[_1]」に一致する行をハイライトしています。',
'log_NO_MATCHING_LINES' => '一致する行は表示されていません。',
'log_FILENAME_ERROR' => '(en)Error while specifying log file name.

  <p>Invalid report type "[_1]".</p>',
'log_REFRESH' => 'このログファイルを更新',
'log_OP_DESC' => '(en)You must choose between viewing the logfile in your browser, or downloading the logfile to your computer. If the logfile is particularly large, you may wish to download it instead of attempting to open it in your browser, as this is a problem for some web browsers.',
'log_OP_LABEL' => '操作',
